[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; A3 — the showcase scene the assignment asks for: a floor, one light, a
; camera, and the three assets side by side at game scale.
;
; Scale reference: the player's collider is 18 x 28 px and the project's
; convention is 16 px = 1 m, so the player is 1.125 x 1.75 m. The three assets
; are 1.8 m apart, about one player-width of clear air between them.
;
; Each asset is placed at y = 0 on purpose. Their origins are at the centre of
; their undersides, so sitting on the floor is the default and floating or
; sinking would be visible immediately — that is the brief's P3 check made
; into the scene's layout rather than left to a script.

[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/models/torch.glb" id="1_torch"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/models/spike_trap.glb" id="2_spike"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/models/slime.glb" id="3_slime"]

